0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 54 427 [
[(To start a note, first we have to mute the output in case)]
[(there's already something playing---otherwise we'll get a)]
[(click. The "cutoff" [line~] then takes 5 msec to get to)]
[(zero. After that amount of delay, we reset the phase to)]
[(sample number 1 and set it in motion. We want the [line~])]
[(output to increase by 1 each sample of output, so we ask)]
[(for it to do 4.8e+08 samples in 1e+07 milliseconds)]
[(\050assuming a sample rate of 48 KHz\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
